---
// BIENVENUE (après l'inscription) : relier sa musique (Deezer, Last.fm : Spotify est limité à quelques comptes),
// choisir ses genres, puis ses artistes, en commençant par ceux retrouvés sur Deezer. Nourrit les recommandations.
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { GENRE_CHIPS } from '../lib/genres';
---

<Layout title="Bienvenue" description="Choisis tes genres et tes artistes pour que BARZ¡ te ressemble.">
  <div class="bz-page">
    <section id="step-music">
      <span class="bz-eyebrow">Étape 1 sur 3</span>
      <h1 class="bz-display">D’où vient <em>ta musique ?</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Relie ton compte : on retrouve tes artistes tout seuls, et tes recos partent de ce que tu écoutes vraiment. Tu pourras le faire plus tard dans les Paramètres.</p>
      <div class="sources">
        <article class="source">
          <h2>Deezer</h2>
          <p>Colle le lien de ton profil : dans Deezer, ton profil → Partager → Copier le lien. Tes favoris doivent être publics.</p>
          <form id="deezer-form" class="source-form">
            <label class="sr-only" for="deezer-input">Lien du profil Deezer</label>
            <input id="deezer-input" class="bz-input" maxlength="300" placeholder="https://www.deezer.com/fr/profile/…" autocomplete="off" />
            <button type="submit" class="bz-btn bz-btn--lime bz-btn--small" id="deezer-submit">Relier</button>
          </form>
          <p class="bz-notice" id="deezer-status" hidden></p>
        </article>
        <article class="source">
          <h2>Last.fm</h2>
          <p>Ton pseudo Last.fm : tes artistes les plus écoutés sont importés. <b>Tu écoutes sur Spotify ?</b> Relie Spotify à Last.fm (Last.fm → Paramètres → Applications), puis donne ton pseudo ici.</p>
          <form id="lastfm-form" class="source-form">
            <label class="sr-only" for="lastfm-input">Pseudo Last.fm</label>
            <input id="lastfm-input" class="bz-input" maxlength="40" placeholder="Ton pseudo Last.fm" autocomplete="off" />
            <button type="submit" class="bz-btn bz-btn--lime bz-btn--small">Relier</button>
            <button type="button" class="bz-btn bz-btn--outline bz-btn--small" data-lastfm-tuto>Tuto</button>
          </form>
          <p class="bz-notice" id="lastfm-status" hidden></p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="source-note">Spotify ne permet de relier que quelques comptes pour l’instant : passe par Last.fm, ça marche aussi bien pour tes recos. Apple Music, YouTube ou autre ? Touche « Plus tard », tu choisiras tes artistes juste après.</p>
      <div class="finish">
        <button type="button" class="bz-btn bz-btn--outline" id="skip-music">Plus tard</button>
        <button type="button" class="bz-btn bz-btn--lime" id="to-genres">Continuer →</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="step-genres" hidden>
      <span class="bz-eyebrow">Étape 2 sur 3</span>
      <h1 class="bz-display">Qu’est-ce que <em>tu écoutes ?</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Choisis au moins un genre. Tu pourras changer d’avis plus tard.</p>
      <div class="genres" id="genre-picks">
        {GENRE_CHIPS.map((c) => (
          <button type="button" class="genre" data-genre={c.id} aria-pressed="false">{c.label}</button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="finish">
        <button type="button" class="bz-btn bz-btn--outline" id="back-music">← Ta musique</button>
        <button type="button" class="bz-btn bz-btn--lime" id="to-artists" disabled>Continuer →</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="step-artists" hidden>
      <span class="bz-eyebrow">Étape 3 sur 3</span>
      <h1 class="bz-display">Tes <em>artistes.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Suis ceux que tu aimes : leurs sorties remonteront en premier, et on te proposera des artistes proches.</p>
      <div class="follow-goal" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="follow-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span id="follow-bar"></span></span>
        <b id="follow-count">Suis 10 artistes pour un vendredi bien rempli</b>
      </div>
      <div class="imported" id="imported-block" hidden>
        <div class="imported-head">
          <h2 class="imported-title" id="imported-title">Retrouvés sur Deezer</h2>
          <button type="button" class="bz-btn bz-btn--outline bz-btn--small" id="follow-all">Tout suivre</button>
        </div>
        <div class="bz-artists" id="imported-grid"></div>
        <h2 class="imported-title">D’autres idées</h2>
      </div>
      <label class="sr-only" for="onboard-q">Chercher un artiste</label>
      <input id="onboard-q" class="bz-input search" type="search" placeholder="Chercher un artiste précis…" autocomplete="off" />
      <div class="bz-artists" id="onboard-grid"></div>
      <div class="finish">
        <button type="button" class="bz-btn bz-btn--outline" id="back-genres">← Genres</button>
        <button type="button" class="bz-btn bz-btn--lime" id="finish">C’est parti →</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  import { ARTIST_LITE, BASE, artistCardHtml, authErrorMessage, errorText, getMyProfile, myFollows, requireSession, searchArtists, setFollow, supabase, updateMyProfile, wireFollowButtons, type ArtistLite } from '../scripts/social';
  import { GENRE_CHIPS } from '../lib/genres';
  import { deezerLink } from '../scripts/deezer';

  const $ = (id: string) => document.getElementById(id)!;
  const next = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('next') || BASE;
  const chosen = new Set<string>();
  let followed = new Set<string>();

  // Objectif : 10 artistes suivis, assez pour que le vendredi et les recommandations aient du sens
  const FOLLOW_GOAL = 10;
  const paintCount = () => {
    const n = followed.size;
    const left = FOLLOW_GOAL - n;
    $('follow-count').textContent = !n
      ? `Suis ${FOLLOW_GOAL} artistes pour un vendredi bien rempli`
      : left > 0
        ? `${n} suivi${n > 1 ? 's' : ''} · plus que ${left} artiste${left > 1 ? 's' : ''}`
        : `${n} artistes suivis : ton vendredi est prêt 🎉`;
    $('follow-bar').style.width = `${Math.min(100, (n / FOLLOW_GOAL) * 100)}%`;
    $('follow-bar').parentElement!.classList.toggle('is-done', left <= 0);
  };

  // Étapes : ta musique → genres → artistes
  const show = (step: 'music' | 'genres' | 'artists') => {
    for (const s of ['music', 'genres', 'artists']) $(`step-${s}`).hidden = s !== step;
    window.scrollTo(0, 0);
  };
  const notice = (id: string, text: string, kind: 'ok' | 'error') => {
    $(id).textContent = text;
    $(id).className = `bz-notice bz-notice--${kind}`;
    $(id).hidden = false;
  };

  $('deezer-form').addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
    event.preventDefault();
    const value = ($('deezer-input') as HTMLInputElement).value.trim();
    if (!value) return;
    const button = $('deezer-submit') as HTMLButtonElement;
    button.disabled = true;
    try {
      const result = await deezerLink(value);
      notice('deezer-status', result.matched ? `Relié : ${result.matched} de tes artistes retrouvés. Tu pourras les suivre en un clic à l’étape 3.` : 'Relié, mais aucun de tes favoris n’est encore dans le catalogue.', 'ok');
    } catch (err) {
      notice('deezer-status', errorText(err), 'error');
    } finally {
      button.disabled = false;
    }
  });

  $('lastfm-form').addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
    event.preventDefault();
    const value = ($('lastfm-input') as HTMLInputElement).value.trim();
    if (!value) return;
    try {
      await updateMyProfile({ lastfm_username: value });
      notice('lastfm-status', `C’est noté : tes écoutes Last.fm (@${value}) seront importées dans les prochaines heures.`, 'ok');
    } catch (err) {
      notice('lastfm-status', errorText(err), 'error');
    }
  });

  $('to-genres').addEventListener('click', () => show('genres'));
  $('skip-music').addEventListener('click', () => show('genres'));
  $('back-music').addEventListener('click', () => show('music'));

  // Artistes retrouvés sur Deezer (ou Spotify) : proposés en premier, à suivre en un clic
  let imported: ArtistLite[] = [];
  async function showImported() {
    const session = await requireSession();
    if (!session || !supabase) return;
    const { data } = await supabase.from('imported_artists').select(`source, weight, artist:artists(${ARTIST_LITE})`).eq('user_id', session.user.id).order('weight', { ascending: false }).limit(24);
    const rows = (data ?? []) as any[];
    imported = rows.map((r) => r.artist).filter(Boolean);
    $('imported-block').hidden = !imported.length;
    if (!imported.length) return;
    $('imported-title').textContent = rows.some((r) => r.source === 'deezer') ? 'Retrouvés sur Deezer' : 'Retrouvés sur Spotify';
    $('imported-grid').innerHTML = imported.map((a) => artistCardHtml(a, followed.has(a.id))).join('');
  }

  $('follow-all').addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const button = $('follow-all') as HTMLButtonElement;
    button.disabled = true;
    try {
      for (const a of imported.filter((x) => !followed.has(x.id))) {
        await setFollow(a.id, true);
        followed.add(a.id);
      }
      $('imported-grid').innerHTML = imported.map((a) => artistCardHtml(a, true)).join('');
      paintCount();
      button.textContent = 'Tous suivis';
    } catch (err) {
      alert(errorText(err));
      button.disabled = false;
    }
  });

  async function init() {
    if (!(await requireSession())) return;
    const profile = await getMyProfile();
    if (profile?.lastfm_username) ($('lastfm-input') as HTMLInputElement).value = profile.lastfm_username;
    for (const g of profile?.favorite_genres ?? []) {
      const chip = GENRE_CHIPS.find((c) => c.genres.includes(g));
      if (chip) chosen.add(chip.id);
    }
    followed = new Set((await myFollows().catch(() => [])).map((a) => a.id));
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-genre]').forEach((b) => b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(chosen.has(b.dataset.genre!))));
    ($('to-artists') as HTMLButtonElement).disabled = chosen.size === 0;
    paintCount();
  }

  $('genre-picks').addEventListener('click', (event) => {
    const button = (event.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-genre]');
    if (!button) return;
    const id = button.dataset.genre!;
    chosen.has(id) ? chosen.delete(id) : chosen.add(id);
    button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(chosen.has(id)));
    ($('to-artists') as HTMLButtonElement).disabled = chosen.size === 0;
  });

  // Les artistes les plus suivis de chaque genre choisi, mélangés
  async function showArtists(query = '') {
    if (!supabase) return;
    const grid = $('onboard-grid');
    let list: ArtistLite[] = [];
    if (query) {
      list = await searchArtists(query, { limit: 24 });
    } else {
      const perGenre = Math.max(6, Math.ceil(30 / chosen.size));
      const lists = await Promise.all(
        [...chosen].map(async (id) => {
          const chip = GENRE_CHIPS.find((c) => c.id === id)!;
          const { data } = await supabase!.from('artists').select(ARTIST_LITE).overlaps('genres', chip.genres).order('popularity', { ascending: false }).limit(perGenre);
          return (data ?? []) as ArtistLite[];
        })
      );
      const seen = new Set<string>();
      for (let i = 0; i < perGenre; i++) {
        for (const l of lists) {
          const a = l[i];
          if (a && !seen.has(a.id)) {
            seen.add(a.id);
            list.push(a);
          }
        }
      }
    }
    grid.innerHTML = list.length ? list.map((a) => artistCardHtml(a, followed.has(a.id))).join('') : '<p class="bz-empty">Aucun artiste trouvé.</p>';
  }

  $('to-artists').addEventListener('click', () => {
    show('artists');
    showImported().catch(() => {});
    showArtists();
  });
  $('back-genres').addEventListener('click', () => show('genres'));

  let timer: number | undefined;
  $('onboard-q').addEventListener('input', (event) => {
    clearTimeout(timer);
    timer = window.setTimeout(() => showArtists((event.target as HTMLInputElement).value.trim()), 250);
  });

  for (const grid of ['onboard-grid', 'imported-grid']) {
    wireFollowButtons($(grid), (id, on) => {
      on ? followed.add(id) : followed.delete(id);
      paintCount();
    });
  }

  $('finish').addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const genres = [...chosen].flatMap((id) => GENRE_CHIPS.find((c) => c.id === id)?.genres ?? []);
    try {
      await updateMyProfile({ favorite_genres: genres, onboarded: true });
      // Puis le guide (comment ça marche, quels comptes connecter), qui mène ensuite à la page demandée
      location.href = `${BASE}guide?premiere=1&next=${encodeURIComponent(next)}`;
    } catch (err) {
      alert(errorText(err));
    }
  });

  init();
</script>

<style>
  /* Objectif de 10 artistes suivis : reste visible en haut pendant qu'on fait défiler les artistes */
  .follow-goal {
    position: sticky;
    top: 8px;
    z-index: 5;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 12px 0 20px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border: var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-hard-sm);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .follow-bar {
    flex: none;
    width: 96px;
    height: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .follow-bar span {
    display: block;
    width: 0;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-ink);
    transition: width 0.25s ease;
  }

  .follow-bar.is-done span {
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 20px 0 36px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .lead b {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .genres {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .genre {
    padding: 34px 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hover);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font: 800 28px/1 var(--font-display);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .genre[aria-pressed='true'] {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-on-accent);
  }

  .sources {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .source {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .source h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font: 800 22px/1 var(--font-display);
  }

  .source p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .source p b {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .source-form {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .source-form .bz-input {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .source-note {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .imported {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .imported-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .imported-title {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font: 600 13px/1 var(--font-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .imported-head .imported-title {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .imported .bz-artists {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .sources {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .search {
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .finish {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .finish .bz-btn {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .finish .bz-btn--outline {
    padding: 14px 22px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  [hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }

  button:disabled {
    opacity: 0.4;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    transform: none;
  }
</style>
